[gd_resource type="ShaderMaterial" load_steps=3 format=3 uid="uid://wardbprmengr1"]

; Institutional green — cast-iron column radiators, and the tiled dado the
; concept art puts behind every sink. Straight off the reference board's
; "FLAKING RADIATOR PAINT" and "SCUFFED LINOLEUM" swatches, which share this
; sage/olive family.
;
; Desaturated hard. The art's green reads as green ONLY next to the cream
; enamel and bone plaster around it; pushed any further it stops looking like
; 1950s hospital paint and starts looking like a colour choice.


; 2026-09-12: shared three-tap wear replaces the flat colour placeholder.
; Retains the authored palette; dirt/chips also vary highlight roughness.

[ext_resource type="Shader" path="res://props/ward_wear.gdshader" id="1_shader"]
[ext_resource type="Texture2D" path="res://props/ward_wear_noise.tres" id="2_noise"]

